/-
  Platonic: the Platonic Representation Theorem in its finite, exact form, and what
  it does not give.

  * `Platonic.Basic`: modalities trained separately with the same objective, through
    injective observations, agree up to rotation; agreement up to rotation is not
    causal agreement.
  * `Platonic.Monomial`: the changes of coordinates that keep uncorrelated coordinates
    uncorrelated are exactly the monomial matrices (renaming and rescaling), and the
    rotations among them are the permutations with signs.
-/
